{"kind": "mod", "id": 1829, "name": "Configurable Stim Uses", "slug": "configurable-stim-uses", "teaser": "Configure the amount of uses of stims. That's it.", "owner_name": "GeneralGoon", "downloads": 2923, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-05-14T03:22:33.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-11-08T15:22:16.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-11-08T15:22:16.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.11.0", "latest_version": "1.0.3", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p><strong>Configure the amount of uses stims have with a config file.</strong></p>\n<p><em><strong>Without editing the config this mod will change nothing</strong></em></p>\n<p><strong>Usage</strong></p>\n<p>To change stim uses:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Open SPT\\user\\mods\\ConfigurableStimUses\\config\\config.json</li>\n<li>Edit <em><strong>“uses”</strong></em> to desire amount</li>\n<li>Save the file</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Installation</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download</li>\n<li>Extract zip to SPT root</li>\n<li>Probably put at bottom of load order</li>\n</ol>\n<p>s/o to Chomp for mod examples</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1147, "published_at": "2024-11-27T14:59:57.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1829/configurable-stim-uses/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.3", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1144, "published_at": "2025-05-11T21:25:59.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1829/configurable-stim-uses/1.0.3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unkn